<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>

    <title>Welcome to MICA</title>
</head>

<body style="
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    background-color: #f5f7f6;
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    color: #25312d;
">

<table
        width="100%"
        cellpadding="0"
        cellspacing="0"
        border="0"
        style="padding: 40px 15px;"
>
    <tr>
        <td align="center">

            <!-- Main Container -->
            <table
                    width="600"
                    cellpadding="0"
                    cellspacing="0"
                    border="0"
                    style="
                    width: 100%;
                    max-width: 600px;
                    background-color: #ffffff;
                    border-radius: 12px;
                    overflow: hidden;
                "
            >

                <!-- Header -->
                <tr>
                    <td
                            style="
                            padding: 32px 40px;
                            text-align: center;
                            border-bottom: 1px solid #edf0ee;
                        "
                    >
                        <h1 style="
                            margin: 0;
                            font-size: 28px;
                            line-height: 1.2;
                            color: #25312d;
                        ">
                            MICA
                        </h1>
                    </td>
                </tr>

                <!-- Content -->
                <tr>
                    <td style="padding: 40px;">

                        <h2 style="
                            margin: 0 0 24px;
                            font-size: 24px;
                            line-height: 1.3;
                            font-weight: 600;
                            color: #25312d;
                        ">
                            Hi {{name}},
                        </h2>

                        <p style="
                            margin: 0 0 18px;
                            font-size: 16px;
                            line-height: 1.7;
                            color: #4b5752;
                        ">
                            Welcome to MICA. We're glad you're here.
                        </p>

                        <p style="
                            margin: 0 0 18px;
                            font-size: 16px;
                            line-height: 1.7;
                            color: #4b5752;
                        ">
                            You've taken the first step toward making your
                            mental wellbeing a priority.
                        </p>

                        <p style="
                            margin: 0 0 28px;
                            font-size: 16px;
                            line-height: 1.7;
                            color: #4b5752;
                        ">
                            To complete your registration and securely
                            activate your MICA account, please verify your
                            email address using the button below.
                        </p>

                        <!-- CTA -->
                        <table
                                width="100%"
                                cellpadding="0"
                                cellspacing="0"
                                border="0"
                                style="margin-bottom: 30px;"
                        >
                            <tr>
                                <td align="center">

                                    <a
                                            href="{{verificationUrl}}"
                                            style="
                                            display: inline-block;
                                            padding: 14px 28px;
                                            background-color: #2f6f5e;
                                            color: #ffffff;
                                            text-decoration: none;
                                            font-size: 16px;
                                            font-weight: 600;
                                            border-radius: 7px;
                                        "
                                    >
                                        Verify My Email
                                    </a>

                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>

                        <p style="
                            margin: 0 0 18px;
                            font-size: 16px;
                            line-height: 1.7;
                            color: #4b5752;
                        ">
                            Once verified, you'll be able to complete your
                            onboarding, explore MICA's wellbeing tools, and
                            begin creating an experience tailored to you.
                        </p>

                        <!-- Privacy Notice -->
                        <table
                                width="100%"
                                cellpadding="0"
                                cellspacing="0"
                                border="0"
                                style="
                                margin: 28px 0;
                                background-color: #f5f8f6;
                                border-radius: 8px;
                            "
                        >
                            <tr>
                                <td style="padding: 20px;">

                                    <p style="
                                        margin: 0;
                                        font-size: 14px;
                                        line-height: 1.7;
                                        color: #53615b;
                                    ">
                                        <strong>Your privacy matters to us.</strong>
                                        MICA is designed with safety, trust,
                                        and responsible care at the heart of
                                        the experience.
                                    </p>

                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>

                        <p style="
                            margin: 0 0 28px;
                            font-size: 14px;
                            line-height: 1.7;
                            color: #717b76;
                        ">
                            If you didn't create a MICA account, you can
                            safely ignore this email.
                        </p>

                        <p style="
                            margin: 0;
                            font-size: 16px;
                            line-height: 1.7;
                            color: #4b5752;
                        ">
                            Welcome to MICA.<br/>
                            <strong>Your wellbeing matters.</strong>
                        </p>

                        <p style="
                            margin: 24px 0 0;
                            font-size: 15px;
                            line-height: 1.6;
                            color: #53615b;
                        ">
                            — The MICA Team
                        </p>

                    </td>
                </tr>

                <!-- Footer -->
                <tr>
                    <td
                            style="
                            padding: 24px 40px;
                            background-color: #fafbfa;
                            border-top: 1px solid #edf0ee;
                            text-align: center;
                        "
                    >
                        <p style="
                            margin: 0;
                            font-size: 12px;
                            line-height: 1.6;
                            color: #8a938f;
                        ">
                            © {{year}} MICA. All rights reserved.
                        </p>
                    </td>
                </tr>

            </table>

        </td>
    </tr>
</table>

</body>
</html>